The integrity test of a file is know as checksum

md5sum and SHA-1 

md5sum filename

md5sum is 32-character hexadecimal string

extension : md5

md5sum -c first.md5 second.md5 In order to check

The integrity test of a directory using `CheckSum`

-r for recursive traversal

-l for using relative path.

using:-
-------

md5sum -rl directory_path > directory.md5

find directory_path -type f -print0 | xargs -0 md5sum >> directory.md5

md5sum -c directory.md5

